 SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'/><span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>3，第三个误区，是买重仓一个板块的基金。比如张坤就是重仓白酒，你最近5年随便买几个头部白酒公司，收益率都比他高。</span></p><p><span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'></span><br style='box-sizing: border-box;outline: none;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'/><span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>葛兰是重仓医药。赵毅是新能源。蔡经理是半导体。这种行业基金涨的时候一定比混合基金多，但一旦下跌，风险非常大。</span></p><p><span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'></span><br style='box-sizing: border-box;outline: none;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rg